{% callout type="warn" title="Check before you tick the box" %}
If you claim free treatment when you are not entitled to it, you may be sent a **penalty charge of up to £100** on top of the charge. If you are not sure, pay and ask for a **refund receipt** (FP57 for prescriptions). You can then claim your money back if it turns out you were entitled.
{% /callout %}
